@startuml module-boundaries
title Engine vs game source boundaries

skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "engine/" as eng {
  folder "include/viscera/" as API <<public API>>
  folder "src/" as EngSrc <<implementation>>
  folder "tests/" as EngTests
}

package "game/" as gme {
  folder "src/" as GameSrc <<entry + gameplay>>
}

GameSrc --> API : include / link\nViscera::Engine
EngTests --> API : tests only
EngSrc -[hidden]-> API

note bottom of eng
  Engine MUST NOT depend on game/
end note

@enduml
